            "excerpt": "Double wide hydraulic scissor lift tables for wide loads, rated 2,000 to 6,000 lb with 24 to 48 in. of travel.",
            "content": "<p>PHS Double Wide Lift Tables use a double wide scissor base to carry wider platforms, with internal power units, heavy-duty cylinders and tubular legs, safety maintenance blocks, lifetime lubricated bearings and standard hand controls.</p>\n<p>Models are rated 2,000, 4,000 or 6,000 lb with 24, 36 or 48 in. of travel and a 7-1/2 in. lowered height, on standard platforms from 48 x 36 in. and maximum platforms up to 72 x 96 in.</p>",
