            "title": "Premier Handling Wide Base Lift Tables",
            "excerpt": "Wide base hydraulic scissor lift tables for larger loads, rated 2,000 to 6,000 lb with 24 to 60 in. of travel.",
            "content": "<p>PHS Wide Base Lift Tables are economical heavy-duty scissor lifts with a wider base for larger loads, with internal power units, heavy-duty cylinders and tubular legs, safety maintenance blocks, lifetime lubricated bearings and standard hand controls.</p>\n<p>Models are rated 2,000, 4,000 or 6,000 lb with 24 to 60 in. of travel, on standard platforms from 36 x 36 in. and maximum platforms up to 84 x 120 in. Options include accordion skirts, oversized or bevelled platforms, pit mounting, a portability package, turntable or tilt table tops, conveyors, PLC control, foot pedal control, an external power unit and a high cycle package.</p>",
