            "slug": "phs-wide-base-tandem-lift-tables",
            "title": "Premier Handling Wide Base Tandem Lift Tables",
            "excerpt": "Tandem hydraulic scissor lift tables with long platforms up to 48 x 220 in., rated 2,000 to 6,000 lb.",
            "content": "<p>PHS Wide Base Tandem Lift Tables pair scissor assemblies under long platforms, with heavy-duty cylinders and tubular legs, safety maintenance blocks, lifetime lubricated bearings and standard hand controls.</p>\n<p>Models are rated 2,000, 4,000 or 6,000 lb with 24 to 60 in. of travel and 8 or 10 in. lowered heights, on standard platforms from 24 x 72 in. and maximum platforms up to 48 x 220 in. Skirts, oversized and bevelled platforms, pit mounting, portability, turntables, conveyors, PLC and foot pedal controls and a high cycle package are available.</p>",
