        {
            "slug": "phs-zero-lift-tables",
            "title": "Premier Handling Zero Lift Tables",
            "excerpt": "Floor-level lift tables that lower to 3/8 in. for pallet jack loading, rated 2,000 or 4,000 lb with 36 in. of travel.",
            "content": "<p>PHS Zero Ground Level Lifts are for work areas without powered fork trucks. They lower to 3/8 in. so pallet jacks and other equipment can load them at floor level, over a bevelled front approach edge.</p>\n<p>Models are rated 2,000 or 4,000 lb with 36 in. of travel, on 44 x 48 or 50 x 48 in. platforms, with external power units, heavy-duty cylinders and legs, safety maintenance blocks and hand controls. Skirts, oversized platforms, conveyors, foot pedal and PLC controls are optional.</p>",
