        {
            "slug": "phs-pneumatic-lift-tables",
            "title": "Premier Handling Pneumatic Lift Tables",
            "excerpt": "Fully air-actuated lift tables for areas where hydraulic oil is prohibited, rated 1,000 to 4,000 lb.",
            "content": "<p>PHS Pneumatic Lift Tables are 100% air actuated and work anywhere plant air is available, with no electrical connections, control boxes or hydraulic cylinders. They suit applications where hydraulic oils are prohibited and need less maintenance than electric hydraulic tables.</p>\n<p>10 Series tables are rated 1,000 lb, 20 Series 2,000 lb and 40 Series 4,000 lb, on platforms from 36 x 48 to 48 x 60 in. Skirts, oversized or bevelled platforms, pit mounting, portability, turntables, tilt tables, conveyors and stainless steel construction are available.</p>",
            "line_code": "Pneumatic 10/20/40",
            "key_features": [
                "Powered by plant air",
