            "content": "<p>PHS Portable Electric Lift Tables are mobile electric scissor lifts for moving and positioning loads between work areas.</p>\n<p>Models are rated 1,000 or 2,000 lb with 24 or 36 in. of travel and a 13-1/2 in. lowered height, on 24 x 36 or 24 x 48 in. standard platforms, with wide base versions on 36 x 36 in. platforms.</p>",
