            "content": "<p>The PHS Stainless Steel Lift Table is a stainless steel scissor lift for sanitary and washdown applications.</p>\n<p>It is rated 4,000 lb, with a 42 x 48 in. platform on a 36 x 48 in. base frame, a 9 in. lowered height and a 33 in. raised height.</p>",
